{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dmaj7]Coffee getting cold [Em7]again
Light is coming [Dmaj7]through [Em7]
[Dmaj7]Yesterday was heavy
[Em7]But this I call to [Dmaj7]mind [Em7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The [Dmaj7]steadfast love of [Em7]the Lord never ceases
His [Dmaj7]mercies never [Em7]come to an end
They are [Dmaj7]new every morning
[Em7]Great is your faithfulness [Dmaj7][Em7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dmaj7]The Lord is my por[Em7]tion
Says my [Dmaj7]soul [Em7]
So [Dmaj7]I will hope in him
[Em7]It is good to wait quietly [Dmaj7][Em7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
